cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the paper below."
title: "Vision-Based Connect-4 Robot"
abstract: "A Raspberry Pi and Arduino robot that reads a Connect-4 board with a camera, accepts only legal one-chip changes, plans with depth-5 minimax, drops a token, and verifies the result with the camera before the game continues."
type: software
